The aws-for-fluent-bit images include third-party software. The build copies
the license files of each component into the image:

  /fluent-bit/licenses/fluent-bit/            Fluent Bit
  /fluent-bit/licenses/fluent-bit/lib/<lib>/  Libraries built into Fluent Bit
  /fluent-bit/licenses/<plugin>/              AWS Go plugins (cloudwatch, firehose, kinesis)
  /fluent-bit/licenses/<plugin>/<module>/     Go modules built into each plugin

On Windows images the same layout is under C:\fluent-bit\licenses.

See scripts/collect-licenses.sh and scripts/license-notices/.
